<a:Step>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 1. Korisnik unosi email i lozinku\f1\lang9242 .\f0\lang1033\par
2. Sistem provjerava postojanje email-a u bazi\par
3. Sistem poredi hashiranu lozinku sa unesenom\par
4. Sistem prepoznaje ulogu korisnika (role)\par
5. Korisnik je preusmjeren na odgovaraju\f1\&#39;e6i dashboard\f0\par
}
</a:Step>
<a:UseCase.Extension>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang9242 1. Pogre\&#39;9ana lozinka ili email -&gt; generi\&#39;e8ka poruka gre\&#39;9ake\par
2. Previ\&#39;9ae neuspje\&#39;9anih poku\&#39;9aaja -&gt; privremena blokada naloga\par
3. Nalog nije aktivan -&gt; obavje\&#39;9atenje korisniku\f1\lang1033\par
}
</a:UseCase.Extension>
<a:Throws>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset1 Cambria Math;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}{\*\mmathPr\mmathFont2\mwrapIndent1440 }\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang9242 - \f1\lang1033 Server gre\f0\&#39;9aka \f2\u8594?\f1  login proces prekinut, korisnik nije prijavljen\par
\f0\lang9242 - \f1 Gubitak konekcije tokom autentifikacije \f2\u8594?\f1  sesija nije kreirana\lang1033\par
}
</a:Throws>
<a:PreCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang9242 1. \f1\lang1033 Korisnik je ve\f0\&#39;e6 registrovan u sistemu (ima nalog)\par
2. Nalog je aktivan (nije blokiran ili deaktiviran)\par
3. Sistem je dostupan (login forma je online)\f1\par
\par
}
</a:PreCondition>
<a:PostCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Korisnik je prijavljen i ima pristup funkcijama prema svojoj ulozi.\par
}
</a:PostCondition>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Sistem mora omogu\f1\&#39;e6iti registrovanim korisnicima prijavu putem email adrese i lozinke. Nakon uspje\&#39;9ane prijave sistem dodjeljuje ulogu i preusmjerava korisnika.\f0\par
}
</a:Description>
<c:AttachedRequirements>
<o:Shortcut Ref="o71"/>
</c:AttachedRequirements>
</o:UseCase>
<o:UseCase Id="o102">
<a:ObjectID>68B674A8-768D-4D36-BD71-7FA1D9F74D81</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Registracija korisnika</a:Name>
<a:Code>FR-01</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1780846468</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>nikol</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1789495742</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>nikol</a:Modifier>
<a:GlobalObjectID/>
<a:Step>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 1. Korisnik popunjava registracionu formu\par
2. Sistem validira ispravnost unesenih podataka\par
3. Sistem provjerava jedinstvenost email adrese\par
4. Lozinka se hashuje i sigurno \f1\lang9242\&#39;e8\f0\lang1033 uva u bazi\par
5. Sistem kreira korisni\f1\lang9242\&#39;e8\f0\lang1033 ni nalog i \f1\lang9242\&#39;9a\f0\lang1033 alje potvrdu\f1\lang9242\par
}
</a:Step>
<a:UseCase.Extension>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset1 Cambria Math;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}{\*\mmathPr\mmathFont2\mwrapIndent1440 }\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 - Email ve\f1\&#39;e6 postoji \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1033  poruka o duplikatu\par
- Neispravni podaci \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1033  poruka sa uputom za ispravku\f0\par
}
</a:UseCase.Extension>
<a:Throws>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset1 Cambria Math;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}{\*\mmathPr\mmathFont2\mwrapIndent1440 }\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang9242 - \f1\lang1033 Server gre\f0\&#39;9aka \f2\u8594?\f1  interni problem, registracija nije zavr\f0\&#39;9aena\par
- Gubitak internet konekcije tokom submita forme \f2\u8594?\f1  podaci nisu poslani\lang1033\par
}
</a:Throws>
<a:PreCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang9242 1. \f1\lang1033 Korisnik nije registrovan u sistemu (nema postoje\f0\&#39;e6i nalog)\par
2. Korisnik ima pristup internetu i mo\&#39;9ee otvoriti aplikaciju\par
3. Registraciona forma je dostupna (sistem je online)\f1\par
}
</a:PreCondition>
<a:PostCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Korisni\f1\&#39;e8ki nalog je kreiran i korisnik mo\&#39;9ee pristupiti sistemu.\f0\par
}
</a:PostCondition>
<a:Description>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fcharset238 Calibri;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\cf1\f0\fs20\lang9242 Sistem mora omogu\&#39;e6iti novim korisnicima da kreiraju nalog unosom li\&#39;e8nih podataka.Registracija je preduslov za kori\&#39;9atenje svih ostalih funkcija sistema.\cf0\f1\fs20\lang1033\par
}
</a:Description>
